  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: complete oauth2 support for generated clients 2026-04-06\n- feat: scaffold grpc client projects from proto 2026-04-03\n- feat: support system.net.http.json generation 2026-04-02\n- feat: generate data annotations validation 2026-04-02\n- feat: expose success response headers via wrappers 2026-04-02\n- feat(docs): scaffold shared mkdocs theme and workflow 2026-04-01\n- feat: add MEAI guide template to autosdk init scaffolding 2026-03-29\n- feat: support dotted schema namespaces (#198) 2026-03-28\n- feat: add TreatWarningsAsErrors to SDK project template 2026-03-27\n- feat: Inline array support and deepObject serialization for object query params 2026-03-22\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- test: fix allof trim assertion 2026-04-06\n- fix: clone oauth2 requests without missing polyfills 2026-04-06\n- fix: sanitize generated authorization helpers 2026-04-06\n- fix: restore trim-safe serializer context for huge unions 2026-04-06\n- fix: support CPM restore for source generators (#222) 2026-04-04\n- fix: repair system.net.http.json snapshot compatibility 2026-04-03\n- fix: reject grpc proto inputs in openapi loader 2026-04-02\n- fix: reject grpc proto inputs across cli commands 2026-04-02\n- fix: detect grpc proto inputs explicitly 2026-04-02\n- fix: normalize fern literal and datetime types 2026-04-02",
